    <item>
      <title>nasa/cea</title>
      <link>https://github.com/nasa/cea</link>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;CEA computes the equilibrium composition of mixtures via free-energy minimization, and uses the resulting product concentrations to determine thermodynamic and transport properties. It includes a large database of species with thermodynamic curve-fit data, and can be used for rocket performance, detonation parameters, and shock-wave analysis.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/link.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;link&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 8px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://nasa.github.io/cea/&quot;&gt;https://nasa.github.io/cea/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;</description>
      
